WEBVTT

00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:16,480
When I did petri dish mold testing in my bathroom, one thing it showed was high candida.

00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:19,200
My husband and I don't have any symptoms of this.

00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:23,040
Should we test or treat ourselves for candida?

00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:32,080
So this person is talking about using a company called Immutal Linux lab,

00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:35,040
where you put these little petri dishes in different parts of your house.

00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:40,720
I'm testing for do I have molds growing in my house that I need to deal with.

00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:46,480
It's a good thing for everybody to do, you know, at least once in their home,

00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,280
because you could have hidden mold behind the wall.

00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:54,080
And you can't see it, you know, you can't smell it.

00:00:54,560 --> 00:00:59,120
And you could be exposed to mycotoxins because of those things.

00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:05,360
Now, if you do have that, you should remediate that area.

00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:11,120
So you should clean that area with recommendations that this company may give you,

00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:20,960
searching for different ways to decrease that candida, in this case, whatever mold is present.

00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:27,680
Should you treat your your body for candida if you had candida exposure?

00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:30,000
No, I wouldn't say so.

00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:36,640
I have no symptoms of candida and you know, never did.

00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:40,560
Should I treat my body for candida?

00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:42,320
I would say no, I would not.

00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:47,120
Just because you're exposed to something doesn't mean that it is a problem.

00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:52,800
Now, if you did a mycotoxin test, a mycotox test is not going to test for candida,

00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:59,600
because candida is a living organism, but it's a yeast that's not.

00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:04,960
So a mycotoxin is a toxin that different molds give off.

00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:07,200
It's not the mold itself.

00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:11,920
So a mycotox test is not testing for living organisms in my body,

00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:14,640
living molds in my body, living yeast in my body.

00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:21,360
A mycotox test is testing for the toxins that those living things can give off that you then

00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:30,160
can breathe in. So in this case, no, I would treat for that unless you had symptoms.

00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:34,640
There's different tests that you could do to see if you have candida, but I wouldn't,

00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:38,240
you could spend anybody on those labs if I didn't have the symptoms.

